940 grams. It is a heavy saree and it is meant to be.', 'Rathinam''s loom again, this time with his elder son Murugan on the border. Twenty-six days from warp to cut.', 42000, null, 'Pure Kanchipuram Silk', 'Turmeric gold', 'saffron', 'Korvai with brocade pallu', '{"Handwoven","Korvai border","Tested zari","Brocade pallu"}', '{wedding,ceremony}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.9m contrast blouse piece in arakku maroon', '{"Dry clean only, and tell the cleaner it is pure zari.","Store folded in the cotton bag it arrived in. Refold along a new line every few months so the zari does not crease in one place.","Keep away from direct sunlight, damp and naphthalene."}', 'cat-kanchipuram', 'col-silk-stories', 2, false, false, true, '2025-07-16T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-07-18T00:00:00.000Z')
