It will crease. It creases in the first hour and then stops mattering.', 'Woven in Bhoodan Pochampally, Telangana, on fly-shuttle looms.', 5400, null, 'Handwoven Linen', 'Slate', 'charcoal', 'Plain weave, 100 count', '{"Handwoven","100 count linen"}', '{work,everyday}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m matching linen blouse piece', '{"Gentle hand wash in cold water, or dry clean if you prefer the crisp finish.","Dry flat in shade. Linen creases, that is the point of it.","Iron on a medium setting while damp."}', 'cat-linen', 'col-everyday', 9, false, false, true, '2025-07-08T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-07-10T00:00:00.000Z')
