The foil butis are applied by hand and will lose a few over years of wear. That is normal for foil work and not a fault.', 'Foiled at the same Chennai unit as the Nithya, in batches of ten.', 11200, null, 'Silk Organza', 'Olive', 'olive', 'Plain woven with foil-printed buti', '{"Hand foiling","Sheer"}', '{ceremony,festive}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m raw silk blouse piece in deep olive', '{"Dry clean only.","Hang rather than fold, on a padded hanger, so the crispness holds.","Never wring. Never iron directly on the fabric, use a muslin cloth."}', 'cat-organza', 'col-new-season', 5, false, true, true, '2025-08-25T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-08-27T00:00:00.000Z')
