The pallu shifts into tissue for the last thirty inches, so it catches light differently to the body.', 'Lohta, Varanasi. Five months, and the pallu alone took six weeks.', 36500, null, 'Katan Silk', 'Wine', 'maroon', 'Cutwork brocade', '{"Handwoven","Cutwork","Real zari"}', '{festive,wedding}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m matching blouse piece, unstitched', '{"Dry clean only, and tell the cleaner it is pure zari.","Store folded in the cotton bag it arrived in. Refold along a new line every few months so the zari does not crease in one place.","Keep away from direct sunlight, damp and naphthalene."}', 'cat-banarasi', 'col-festive-edit', 2, false, false, true, '2025-07-22T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-07-24T00:00:00.000Z')
