Best worn with something unexpected on top. A dark blouse, or none of the usual gold.', 'Chanderi town, from the same cooperative as the Suhasini.', 8900, null, 'Chanderi Silk-Cotton', 'Chalk white', 'ivory', 'Plain with gold checks', '{"Handwoven","Zari check"}', '{ceremony,work}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m matching blouse piece, unstitched', '{"Dry clean recommended for the first year.","Store rolled rather than sharply folded, the silk-cotton mix marks easily.","Steam iron on low, always on the reverse."}', 'cat-chanderi', 'col-new-season', 0, false, false, true, '2025-08-02T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-08-04T00:00:00.000Z')
