The undyed border thread will lighten slightly with washing while the body holds its green.', 'Bhoodan Pochampally, Telangana.', 6200, null, 'Handwoven Linen', 'Moss', 'olive', 'Plain weave with temple border', '{"Handwoven","Temple border"}', '{work,everyday}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m matching linen blouse piece', '{"Gentle hand wash in cold water, or dry clean if you prefer the crisp finish.","Dry flat in shade. Linen creases, that is the point of it.","Iron on a medium setting while damp."}', 'cat-linen', 'col-everyday', 7, false, true, true, '2025-08-26T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-08-28T00:00:00.000Z')
