Under lamplight the saffron goes almost amber.', 'Woven in Bengaluru and finished in Chennai.', 10400, null, 'Silk Organza', 'Saffron', 'saffron', 'Plain woven with zari border', '{"Sheer","Zari border"}', '{festive,ceremony}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m raw silk blouse piece in saffron', '{"Dry clean only.","Hang rather than fold, on a padded hanger, so the crispness holds.","Never wring. Never iron directly on the fabric, use a muslin cloth."}', 'cat-organza', 'col-festive-edit', 4, false, false, true, '2025-07-25T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-07-27T00:00:00.000Z')
