720 grams and it drapes softly for a Kanchipuram of this weight.', 'Vasanthi cooperative, Kanchipuram. Nineteen days.', 31000, null, 'Pure Kanchipuram Silk', 'Teal and gold', 'teal', 'Korvai with checked body', '{"Handwoven","Korvai border","Tested zari","Zari check"}', '{festive,wedding,ceremony}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.8m contrast blouse piece in gold', '{"Dry clean only, and tell the cleaner it is pure zari.","Store folded in the cotton bag it arrived in. Refold along a new line every few months so the zari does not crease in one place.","Keep away from direct sunlight, damp and naphthalene."}', 'cat-kanchipuram', 'col-silk-stories', 3, false, false, true, '2025-07-11T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-07-13T00:00:00.000Z')
