The tissue pallu keeps the total weight at 890 grams, light for a wedding piece.', 'Vasanthi cooperative, Kanchipuram. Eleven weeks.', 51000, null, 'Pure Kanchipuram Silk', 'Rose gold', 'rose', 'Korvai with tissue pallu', '{"Handwoven","Korvai border","Tested zari","Tissue pallu"}', '{wedding,ceremony}'::occasion[], 6.3, 1.15, '0.9m contrast blouse piece in deep rose', '{"Dry clean only, and tell the cleaner it is pure zari.","Store folded in the cotton bag it arrived in. Refold along a new line every few months so the zari does not crease in one place.","Keep away from direct sunlight, damp and naphthalene."}', 'cat-wedding', 'col-bridal', 2, false, false, true, '2025-08-09T00:00:00.000Z', '2025-08-11T00:00:00.000Z')
